WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.420
Speaker 1: One last thing on the Herschel Walker&nbsp;
stuff. Herschel Walker appeared on Fox News. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:11.880
was asked, why did your own son come out against&nbsp;
you? That was really damaging to your campaign.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:16.140
As many of you know, we covered that. Christian&nbsp;
Walker, a right wing influencer who is Herschel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:22.200
Walker son, denounced Herschel Walker, said he&nbsp;
would threaten us. He tried to kill us. We had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.880
to move six times as a result of his threats. He's&nbsp;
a fake. He's a phony. All these different things.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:31.800
Christian Walker denouncing his own father.&nbsp;
Herschel Walker appearing on Fox News, being asked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:36.120
about it, and his answer is completely incoherent.
Speaker 2: He's doing tremendous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.980
damage to you by coming.
Speaker 3: Out with those&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:43.560
statements. Do you know why he's saying this?
Speaker 2: Well, the damage he's doing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:49.080
is letting people know that the left will do&nbsp;
whatever they can. To win his. And I told you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:53.280
when I got in this race, I'm going to win this&nbsp;
seat. People see someone sitting here in front&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:58.020
of you right now. They've been reading. And&nbsp;
I want America to know I'm living proof that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:02.160
you can make mistakes and get up and keep going&nbsp;
forward. But you can only do it in this country&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:07.549
right here. And you can only do it. And we get&nbsp;
this election rhetoric, this come November.&nbsp;

00:01:07.549 --> 00:01:13.920
Speaker 1: What? What on earth is that have to do&nbsp;
with your son, the Democrats? His son is a public&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:21.660
MAGA right winger. His own son has decided to tell&nbsp;
the country, my dad sucks, for lack of a better&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:28.980
term. That has nothing to do with Democrats and&nbsp;
this absurd rambling answer. I have to tell you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:35.220
on the one hand, this has to be extraordinarily&nbsp;
difficult for Herschel Walker, and I empathize&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:40.920
with that to see your son turn against you in&nbsp;
this way. But it also has nothing to do with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:47.100
Democrats whatsoever. But maybe the saddest thing&nbsp;
about it all is many Republicans who just don't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:50.940
want Raphael Warnock to be the next senator in&nbsp;
Georgia or to continue being a senator in Georgia.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:56.580
Better said, since he's the incumbent. That wild,&nbsp;
rambling nonsense that we just heard from Herschel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.580 --> 00:02:02.100
Walker. They'll probably accept it and that's good&nbsp;
enough for them and say, hey, listen, he addressed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:07.200
it, did he? He talked about Democrats. His son's&nbsp;
a MAGA right winger. Everybody makes mistakes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:14.520
of different degrees, but to not own up to&nbsp;
them. And again, it's not a mistake to pay&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:19.380
for an abortion if you're coercing a woman to&nbsp;
get one. That's a different story. And that may&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:25.920
be part of the story. But the mistake of staking&nbsp;
out a completely dishonest public position that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:29.400
goes against everything that you have going&nbsp;
in your life privately and then lying about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:33.720
it and then not admitting that that's what&nbsp;
happened. It does show a lack of character&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:38.580
and a lack of conscience. And to blame it all&nbsp;
on Democrats who have nothing to do with your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:44.760
own son turning against you is really pathetic.&nbsp;
Again, I think we have 24 to 48 hours left of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:50.040
this scandal before a complete implosion. I expect&nbsp;
Walker's campaign to be all but over by Monday.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:55.860
We'll have these clips on our Instagram. Find&nbsp;
us on Instagram by searching David Pakman show.

